# Google Maps Platform API Key (Client-side Maps JavaScript API, Places API New, Routes API)
#
# Quickstart for Prototyping (Free Maps Demo Key - No billing or Cloud project required):
#   1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Sign in with any Google account (no credit card required).
#   3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
#   4. Click the button to generate / reveal your Maps Demo Key.
#   5. Copy this file to `.env.local` and paste your key below.
#
# Note: The Maps Demo Key has a daily reset limit and is for prototyping only.
# For production, create a restricted key in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0

VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
